[]($section)

so you want to give me money?

im available for *remote* freelance work, contract work, and potentially part time work. while im
primarily interested in systems programming, low level software, networking, and linux infrastructure,
im not opposed to weird projects.

## money

depends on your budget really, why not give it a shot by [talking to me](/socials). i can use
non-standard methods of payment if required.

## what i can do

* systems programming in c, zig, and go
* linux software and tooling
* networking and network services
* low level programming and osdev
* http servers and other network software
* linux server administration and self-hosting
* build systems, ci, and deployment

im also comfortable learning new tech when a project needs it.

## what im looking for

id prefer work involving:

* c / zig / go
* linux
* systems or infrastructure
* networking
* open source
* other interesting problems

but im very open to working with other stuff, in which case [hit me up](/socials), lets talk

## availability

im a student, so my availability is somewhat limited and depends on the project. im generally
better suited to freelance or contract work, [but we can always talk](/socials))
